 from the publisher.","work_id":"doi:10.1177/0956797614553946"},"paper_says":[{"anchor_id":"A2.10","match":{"native":"NORMALIZED_MATCH_ONLY","plain":"Found in the paper's text, differing only in spacing or line breaks","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"page":1,"refs":["urn:atlas:extraction:s2-claim-map:1/anchor/A2.10"],"section":"untitled opening section","text":"Consistent with the findings of Carney et al., our results showed a significant effect of power posing on self-reported feelings of power."},{"anchor_id":"A2.2","match":{"native":"NORMALIZED_MATCH_ONLY","plain":"Found in the paper's text, differing only in spacing or line breaks","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"page":1,"refs":["urn:atlas:extraction:s2-claim-map:1/anchor/A2.2"],"section":"untitled opening section","text":"However, we found no significant effect of power posing on hormonal levels or in any of the three behavioral tasks."},{"anchor_id":"A2.3","match":{"native":"NORMALIZED_MATCH_ONLY","plain":"Found in the paper's text, differing only in spacing or line breaks","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"page":2,"refs":["urn:atlas:extraction:s2-claim-map:1/anchor/A2.3"],"section":"Results","text":"Two-tailed t tests indicated no significant impact of physical position on either risk-taking in the gain domain (mean difference = −0.033, 95% CI = [−0.085, 0.019]), t(198) = −1.245, p = .215, Cohen’s d = −0.176, or changes in testosterone (mean difference = −4.077, 95% CI = [−9.801, 1.647]), t(196) = −1.405, p = .162, Cohen’s d = −0.200."},{"anchor_id":"A2.6","match":{"native":"NORMALIZED_MATCH_ONLY","plain":"Found in the paper's text, differing only in spacing or line breaks","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"page":2,"refs":["urn:atlas:extraction:s2-claim-map:1/anchor/A2.6"],"section":"Discussion","text":"Using a much larger sample size but similar procedures as Carney et al. did, we failed to confirm an effect of power posing on testosterone, cortisol, and financial risk taking."},{"anchor_id":"A2.7","match":{"native":"NORMALIZED_MATCH_ONLY","plain":"Found in the paper's text, differing only in spacing or line breaks","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"page":2,"refs":["urn:atlas:extraction:s2-claim-map:1/anchor/A2.7"],"section":"Discussion","text":"We did find that power posing affected self-reported feelings of power; however, this did not yield behavioral effects."}],"paper_says_note":"5 passages are shown because they are already public excerpts. The other 43 quoted passages were checked against the paper but are not reproduced here.","question":"What does the record show about this claim?","related":[{"identity":{"native":"NOT_THE_SAME_AUDIT_TARGET","plain":"About a different paper, so not the same claim","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"refs":["urn:atlas:extraction:s2-claim-map:1/cross-map/provisional-field-6","urn:atlas:claimlink:power-posing-reviewed:1/statement/map-field-6/06b70172cc15f188"],"relation":{"native":"DIFFERENT_TARGET_WORKS","plain":"Different papers","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"state":"UNCHANGED; read from its pinned receipt","text":"An earlier claim map exists, made by a different audit. It is about a different paper, doi:10.1177/0956797610383437, so it is not the same claim."}],"reviews":[{"context":"Made for an earlier audit whose target is a different paper. It judged whether passages from this paper support a sentence about what this paper reports.","disposition":{"native":"SUPPORTS_WITH_QUALIFICATION","plain":"Reviewer: the passage supports this, with qualifications","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"human_adjudication":{"native":"human_adjudication: NOT_RECORDED","plain":"No person has ruled on this","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"independence":{"native":"independence: NOT_ESTABLISHED","plain":"Independence: not established","table":"atlas-plain-labels/0.1"},"paper_quotes_inside_its_passages":["A2.10","A2.2","A2.6","A2.7"],"parts":[{"disposition":{"native":"SUPPORTS","plain":"Reviewer: the passage supports this","table":